# Leave unset to auto-detect LAN IP from Expo (recommended for physical devices / Expo Go).
# Set explicitly only when you need a fixed host:
#   Android emulator: http://10.0.2.2:3000
#   iOS simulator:    http://localhost:3000
#   Physical device:  http://<your-lan-ip>:3000
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
